Theorem RL-33: projection propagation — projected field Owned promotes source to Owned

  Preconditions:
    - RL-33 governs projection propagation per Annex E §AIMS Borrow
      Inference: "Projection propagation: if a projected field becomes Owned,
      the source variable SHALL be promoted to Owned."
    - Signature ArcFunction x AimsStateMap -> ArcFunction per
      the canonical proof notation:264; discharged against the sec-01
      Realization.proof sorry obligation.
    - A Project (TF-4) creates a Borrowed view of a source aggregate; if that
      view is promoted to Owned (the field is consumed / stored), the source
      must also be Owned for the field ownership to be valid.
    - Shipped: borrow/mod.rs (borrow inference propagation).
    - depends-on RL-32 (the Borrowed-init / Owned-promotion fixpoint) +
      sec-01.9 borrow_sources (the projection source).

  Soundness property:
    Forall projected field d = Project(src.f) and its source variable src:

      (P1) Propagation: if d's inferred access becomes Owned, RL-33 promotes
           src to Owned; if d stays Borrowed, src keeps its prior access.

      (P2) Soundness: owning a projected field requires owning (a reference
           into) the source aggregate — a Borrowed source cannot back an Owned
           field (the field would outlive the borrow). Promoting src to Owned
           keeps the ownership coherent: the source's RC obligation covers the
           owned field.

    RL-33 propagates ownership UP the projection chain so the borrow-inference
    fixpoint stays coherent across Project boundaries.

  Proof obligation:
    Constructive discharge by the case_analysis engine.

    Part (P1/P2) — propagation cases:
      Owned field over a Borrowed source -> source promoted to Owned;
      Borrowed field -> source unchanged.
      Coverage gate: 2 propagation cases. Negative-direction witness: an Owned
      field over a Borrowed source is INCOHERENT (the field cannot own what
      the source merely borrows) — RL-33 MUST force the source to Owned;
      leaving it Borrowed is rejected.

    Engines dispatched:
      case_analysis (PRIMARY —
        section_08::verify_rl33_projection_owned_propagation; propagation
        enumeration + incoherent-ownership witness; emits Fail on a
        non-propagating Owned field)
      rc_counting (SECONDARY — gracious-accept per the coverage-manifest RL
        row)
      refinement (SECONDARY — gracious-accept per the coverage-manifest RL
        row)

  Expected:
    status: valid
    reason: section_08 case_analysis engine discharges RL-33 via projection Owned-promotion (an Owned projected field forces its source to Owned; a Borrowed field leaves the source unchanged) with a negative-direction witness rejecting the incoherent Owned-field-over-Borrowed-source state, keeping the borrow-inference fixpoint coherent across Project boundaries
